# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile
@host = https://localhost:7184

### 1. Registreren
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "mauro2",
  "password": "geheim123"
}

### 2. Inloggen
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "mauro2",
  "password": "geheim123"
}

### 3. Alle rooms ophalen
GET {{host}}/rooms

### 4. Bookings van een room ophalen
GET {{host}}/rooms/1/bookings

### 5. Nieuwe booking maken (token nodig)
POST {{host}}/rooms/1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..hiCZH27rvVu9C8ZntF8ng2uumaetKsSZkoZ8Gh2jJAo

{
  "title": "Teamoverleg",
  "startTime": "2026-03-02T09:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-03-02T10:00:00",
  "BookedBy": "admin"
}

### 6. Booking verwijderen (token nodig)
DELETE {{host}}/rooms/1/bookings/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..hiCZH27rvVu9C8ZntF8ng2uumaetKsSZkoZ8Gh2jJAo


### 7. Alle equipment van een room ophalen
GET {{host}}/rooms/1/equipment